  "properties": {
    "title": "Building Digital Twins with Open-Source mago3DTiler & mago3DTerrainer",
    "description": "mago3DTiler and mago3DTerrainer are open-source tools designed to support standards-based digital twin workflows from diverse geospatial data.\r\n\r\nThis session highlights the latest capabilities of both projects, including OGC 3D Tiles 1.1 support, terrain generation, GIS-to-3D conversion, and performance optimization, showing how they simplify the creation of interoperable digital twin applications.\r\n\r\nWe conclude by sharing the projects' roadmap and our vision for continued open-source collaboration.",
